0.2.0
    * Fix default RT division by zero, sample capacity and expired-sample averages.
    * Preserve request protection and RT ownership across internal redirects.
    * Refresh metric variables independently and validate configuration values.
    * Fix swap threshold scaling and validate Linux memory counters.
    * Correct FreeBSD page units and handle optional counters on a best-effort basis.
    * Add Tengine-compatible CPU protection with bounded Linux counter parsing.
    * Add nginx integration tests and a four-variant GitHub Actions matrix.

v0.1.0 [Thu Feb 23 2017 YoungJoo.Kim <vozltx@gmail.com>]
    * The first version.

    * Feature: changed the algorithm for calculating response time
      in sysguard_rt directive to avoid being stuck in 503 after redirect.

    * Feature: added "method=" option in sysguard_rt directive.

    * Feature: added embedded Variables.

